sequenceDiagram
    actor W as Warden
    participant UI as Web UI (C1)
    participant AC as Auth & Access (C2)
    participant ST as Student Module (C3)
    participant DA as Data Access (C9)
    participant DB as MySQL (C10)
    participant AU as Audit (C8)
    W->>UI: submit Add Student form (with CSRF token)
    UI->>AC: verify session & role (Admin/Warden)
    AC-->>UI: authorised
    UI->>ST: register(student data)
    ST->>ST: validate mandatory fields & formats
    ST->>DA: exists(student_id)?
    DA->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE student_id = ? (parameterised)
    DB-->>DA: result
    alt validation fails OR Student ID already exists
        ST-->>UI: 400 field errors / 409 "Student ID already registered"
        UI-->>W: show error message
    else all data valid and ID is new
        ST->>DA: save(student)
        DA->>DB: INSERT student
        DB-->>DA: saved
        ST->>AU: log(user, CREATE student, id, time)
        ST-->>UI: 201 Created
        UI-->>W: success message + student record
    end
